    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d993">

                <pb facs="0936" n="924" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg924"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.6363/1223</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Letter to President Roosevelt</hi><anchor n="21"
                        xml:id="d993-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-26">June 26, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: As an outcome of
                    discussion held in the Office of Justice Byrnes, representatives of State, Navy,
                    War and Interior Departments met to consider the situation presented by our
                    prospective shortage of domestic petroleum reserves and the consequent
                    imperative need to assure adequate foreign reserves, and the best means of
                    proceeding to that end. They in addition gave particular attention to the
                    situation in Saudi Arabia. They have agreed upon a signed report which we are
                    transmitting to you. We concur and support this report. You will note that if
                    one of its main recommendations is to be put into effect, that is, the creation
                    of the Petroleum Reserve Corporation, it would be most desirable that this
                    action be taken before July 1.<anchor n="22" xml:id="d993-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cordell Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry</hi> L. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of War</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">James</hi> V. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Forrestal</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary of the Navy</hi>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harold</hi> L. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Ickes</hi>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of the Interior</hi>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d993-a1.xml" xpointer="d993-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d993-f1" n="21" type="source" xml:id="d993-f1-content">
                <p>Sent by the Secretary of State, the Secretary of War, the Acting Secretary of the
                    Navy, and the Secretary of the Interior.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d993-f2" n="22" xml:id="d993-f2-content">
                <p>This was done on June 30.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
